---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
---

<figure class="agent-demo">
  <div class="shot">
    <video src={`${base}media/agent-demo.mp4`} poster={`${base}media/agent-demo.jpg`} width="1600" height="1214" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="Claude Code adds tests to a Kurlo collection over MCP, finds that an order total ignores quantity, fixes the server and runs the collection again while the tests appear in Kurlo"></video>
  </div>
  <figcaption>A real run, sped up 4×. Claude Code gets one prompt, writes the tests over <code>kurlo mcp</code>, finds that the order total ignores quantity and fixes the server. The tests appear in Kurlo as they are saved.</figcaption>
</figure>
<script is:inline>
  (() => {
    const video = document.currentScript.previousElementSibling.querySelector('video');
    if (!video || !matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) return;
    video.removeAttribute('autoplay');
    video.pause();
    video.controls = true;
  })();
</script>
